-- A regulative rule whose own GIVEN carries a TYPICALLY. BPMN has no default for
-- a process variable, so the export reports P-TYPICALLY instead of dropping the
-- presumption without a word.
DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF Member
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF pay

GIVEN `is in good standing` IS A BOOLEAN TYPICALLY TRUE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`the duty` MEANS
    PARTY Member
    MUST pay
    PROVIDED `is in good standing`
    WITHIN 14
